# stray pre-existing symlinks in the skills dir (not project files)

# agentmemory local state. The server writes its database and managed engine
# binary under ~/.agentmemory (global, outside the repo) by default, but
# `--data-dir .` or an AGENTMEMORY_DATA_DIR override would drop a state store
# and a pinned iii-engine binary into the working tree. Never commit either.
.agentmemory/
data/state_store.db
data/iii-config.yaml
